# Line endings are part of the contract, not a local preference.
#
# `schema/` carries artifacts the App Store pins by SHA-256 over their exact raw
# bytes. Git's own autocrlf would rewrite those bytes on a Windows checkout —
# and did: the Windows CI job computed c4ac157f… for a schema the ledger records
# as 67777152…, which is precisely the CRLF hash of the same file. A digest that
# depends on who checked the repository out pins nothing.
#
# Declared for the whole tree rather than just schema/, because the same is true
# of anything else whose bytes are compared: fixtures, corpora, and the archives
# built from them.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Never touched at all: their bytes ARE the artifact.
packages/app-runtime/schema/** -text
*.zip -text
*.tgz -text
